notes from what ive learned so far
1. how to operate github
 under this ive learned how to use various commands to update my github,
		~git add, commit --m , push origin main.
something to be caugtous of is making sure your updating your specific branch and not changing something else. to do this i make sure i constantly run
		~git branch
that way i avoid pushing the wrong thing. anothing thing is how you push. pushing origin main adds it to the main repo/master repo. another way to add what your doing is push <branch>
2. constantly run git status~ i find this very important as it shows your progress and helps avoid making unessessary pushes. Especially when working with a team.
